/* 运营后台（设计稿里没有）：头部沿用协议页，按钮、输入框、卡片沿用现有页面的尺寸和颜色 */
.ad-header { position: relative; height: calc(385rpx + var(--sx-safe-top)); color: #FFFFFF; }
.ad-back {
  position: absolute; left: 23rpx; top: calc(15rpx + var(--sx-safe-top));
  display: flex; align-items: center; height: 85rpx; padding: 0 15rpx;
}
.ad-back__icon { display: block; width: 38rpx; height: 38rpx; }
.ad-header__title { position: absolute; left: 38rpx; top: calc(115rpx + var(--sx-safe-top)); font-size: 58rpx; line-height: 77rpx; font-weight: 900; }
.ad-tabs { position: absolute; left: 38rpx; bottom: 31rpx; display: flex; gap: 15rpx; }
.ad-tab {
  display: flex; align-items: center; box-sizing: border-box;
  height: 85rpx; padding: 0 38rpx; border-radius: 42rpx; border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 27rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF;
}
.ad-tab--on { background: #FFFFFF; color: #010439; }

.ad-body { padding: 38rpx 38rpx calc(77rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
.ad-card { padding: 31rpx; border-radius: 31rpx; background: #F5F5F5; }
.ad-gap { margin-top: 19rpx; }
.ad-hint { margin-top: 23rpx; font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 35rpx; color: #5E6170; }
.ad-empty { margin-top: 46rpx; font-size: 25rpx; line-height: 38rpx; color: #5E6170; }
.ad-skel { height: 200rpx; margin-top: 23rpx; border-radius: 31rpx; }

/* 主按钮（黄绿）和描边按钮 */
.ad-btn {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 104rpx; margin-top: 38rpx; border-radius: 52rpx;
  background: #C2E541; color: #010439; font-size: 31rpx; font-weight: 900;
}
.ad-btn--line { box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 2rpx solid #010439; }
.ad-btn--busy { opacity: .5; }

/* 输入 */
.ad-field { margin-bottom: 27rpx; }
.ad-label { display: block; font-size: 25rpx; line-height: 38rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #010439; }
.ad-input { box-sizing: border-box; height: 92rpx; margin-top: 12rpx; padding: 0 27rpx; border-radius: 23rpx; background: #FFFFFF; font-size: 29rpx; color: #010439; }
.ad-textarea { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; height: 300rpx; margin-top: 12rpx; padding: 23rpx 27rpx; border-radius: 23rpx; background: #FFFFFF; font-size: 29rpx; line-height: 44rpx; color: #010439; }
.ad-ph { color: #9A9CA8; }
.ad-switch-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 85rpx; }
.ad-switch { position: relative; width: 100rpx; height: 58rpx; border-radius: 29rpx; background: #C9CEE8; transition: background .2s; }
.ad-switch--on { background: #010439; }
.ad-switch__dot { position: absolute; left: 6rpx; top: 6rpx; width: 46rpx; height: 46rpx; border-radius: 23rpx; background: #FFFFFF; transition: transform .2s; }
.ad-switch--on .ad-switch__dot { transform: translateX(42rpx); background: #C2E541; }

/* 活动列表 */
.ad-list { margin-top: 8rpx; }
.ad-event { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6rpx; margin-top: 23rpx; padding: 31rpx; border-radius: 31rpx; background: #F5F5F5; }
.ad-event__top { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 19rpx; }
.ad-event__title { min-width: 0; font-size: 31rpx; line-height: 46rpx; font-weight: 900; color: #010439; }
.ad-event__meta { font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 35rpx; color: #5E6170; }
.ad-event__btns { display: flex; gap: 15rpx; margin-top: 19rpx; }
.ad-chip { flex-shrink: 0; padding: 4rpx 19rpx; border-radius: 23rpx; font-size: 21rpx; line-height: 35rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.ad-chip--published { background: #C2E541; color: #010439; }
.ad-chip--draft { background: #E6E6E7; color: #5E6170; }
.ad-chip--ended { background: #E6E6E7; color: #5E6170; }
.ad-mini {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; height: 69rpx; padding: 0 38rpx; border-radius: 35rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9CEE8; font-size: 25rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #010439;
}
.ad-mini--on { background: #010439; border-color: #010439; color: #FFFFFF; }

/* 积分 */
.ad-search { display: flex; gap: 15rpx; margin-bottom: 31rpx; }
.ad-search__input { flex: 1; margin-top: 0; background: #F5F5F5; }
.ad-search__btn { flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 92rpx; padding: 0 42rpx; border-radius: 46rpx; background: #010439; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 27rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.ad-member { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 23rpx; padding-bottom: 27rpx; }
.ad-member__text { min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4rpx; }
.ad-member__name { font-size: 31rpx; line-height: 46rpx; font-weight: 900; color: #010439; }
.ad-member__meta { font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 35rpx; color: #5E6170; }
.ad-member__points { flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; }
.ad-member__points-label { font-size: 21rpx; line-height: 31rpx; color: #5E6170; }
.ad-member__points-num { font-size: 65rpx; line-height: 73rpx; color: #061A70; }
.ad-sign { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12rpx; }
.ad-sign__btn { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 85rpx; border-radius: 19rpx; background: #FFFFFF; font-size: 25rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #14141E; }
.ad-sign__btn--on { background: #010439; color: #FFFFFF; }

/* 电脑端 */
.ad-web__title { margin-bottom: 19rpx; font-size: 31rpx; line-height: 46rpx; font-weight: 900; color: #010439; }
.ad-web__step { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 15rpx; margin-top: 12rpx; }
.ad-web__no { flex-shrink: 0; width: 31rpx; font-size: 31rpx; line-height: 42rpx; color: #061A70; }
.ad-web__text { font-size: 27rpx; line-height: 42rpx; color: #14141E; }
.ad-web__url { margin-top: 31rpx; padding-top: 27rpx; border-top: 1px solid #E6E6E7; }
.ad-web__url-text { display: block; margin-top: 8rpx; font-size: 25rpx; line-height: 38rpx; color: #5E6170; word-break: break-all; }
.ad-web__code-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 12rpx; margin-top: 23rpx; padding: 46rpx 31rpx; border-radius: 31rpx; color: #FFFFFF; }
.ad-web__code { font-size: 77rpx; line-height: 92rpx; letter-spacing: 4rpx; color: #C2E541; white-space: nowrap; }
.ad-web__code-hint { font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 35rpx; color: #C9CEE8; text-align: center; }
